# Secrets and credentials
#
# The tracked `.env` currently holds ONLY Supabase publishable (anon) values and
# the project URL — these are public by design and already ship inside the
# client bundle. Never add a service-role key, provider credential, signing key
# or session key to it: anything secret belongs in a file matched below, which
# git will refuse to track.
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.production
.env.secret
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
secrets.json
# Tauri update-signing private key (public key belongs in tauri.conf.json)
*.tauri-key

# OCADE local progress ledger (never commit; local-only)
.claude/
.codex/
.codex/
